window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Jules, a talented African American architect, is frustrated by the inability to break through the glass ceiling at his firm. He is also engaged with a woman who he does not truly love — a woman who appears more interested in being a socialite rather than his supportive partner. He opts to discover true love online - where he meets this alluring, radiant seductress, Chelle. Chelle has her own challenges to overcome. Two years removed from an emotionally abusive relationship, she enters the online dating world - encouraged by her longtime friend and former classmate Nicole. Chelle and Jules’ worlds collide while they simultaneously struggle to navigate obstacles in both their individual private and professional spheres. A series of short stories comprised of deception, infidelity, materialistic greed, and sexual fantasy - will these two ultimately discover true happiness? Together or apart? Find out Under the Crescent Moon!</p>"; 
